  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calculator</h1>\n    <form id=\"calc-form\" novalidate>\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <label for=\"left\">Left number</label>\n        <input id=\"left\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"e.g. -3.5\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n        <select id=\"operation\">\n          <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n          <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n          <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n          <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n        </select>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <label for=\"right\">Right number</label>\n        <input id=\"right\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"e.g. 2\">\n      </div>\n      <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"submit\">Calculate</button>\n    </form>\n    <div class=\"result-box\">\n      <span class=\"result-label\">Result</span>\n      <output id=\"result\" for=\"left operation right\">0</output>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --muted: #a0a0b0;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  padding: 1rem;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.card {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  padding: 1.5rem;\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #0f0f1a;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 1.25rem;\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.field {\n  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n\ninput,\nselect {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem;\n  font: inherit;\n  color: var(--text);\n  background: #0f0f1a;\n  border: 2px solid var(--muted);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  outline: none;\n}\n\ninput:focus,\nselect:focus {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent);\n}\n\nbutton {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 0.75rem;\n  margin-top: 0.25rem;\n  font: inherit;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #fff;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  border: 2px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, background 0.15s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: #ff5c7a;\n  border-color: #ff5c7a;\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  background: #c92a45;\n  border-color: #c92a45;\n}\n\n.result-box {\n  margin-top: 1.25rem;\n  padding: 0.75rem;\n  background: #0f0f1a;\n  border: 2px solid var(--muted);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.result-label {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n}\n\n#result {\n  display: block;\n  margin-top: 0.25rem;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const form = document.getElementById('calc-form');\nconst leftInput = document.getElementById('left');\nconst rightInput = document.getElementById('right');\nconst operation = document.getElementById('operation');\nconst result = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction parseNumber(value) {\n  if (value.trim() === '') return NaN;\n  const num = Number(value);\n  return Number.isFinite(num) ? num : NaN;\n}\n\nfunction compute(a, b, op) {\n  switch (op) {\n    case 'add': return a + b;\n    case 'subtract': return a - b;\n    case 'multiply': return a * b;\n    case 'divide': return b === 0 ? NaN : a / b;\n    default: return NaN;\n  }\n}\n\nform.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {\n  event.preventDefault();\n  const a = parseNumber(leftInput.value);\n  const b = parseNumber(rightInput.value);\n  if (Number.isNaN(a) || Number.isNaN(b)) {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  const out = compute(a, b, operation.value);\n  result.textContent = Number.isFinite(out) ? String(out) : 'Error';\n});\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Calculator\n\nA tiny offline pixel-style calculator for two numbers.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a **left number** and a **right number** (negative values are allowed).\n3. Choose an **operation**: add, subtract, multiply, or divide.\n4. Press **Calculate** (or press Enter). The result appears in the output box.\n\n## Behavior\n\n- Invalid input (empty, non-numeric, or non-finite) shows exactly `Error`.\n- Division by zero shows exactly `Error`.\n- The output contains only the numeric result (or `Error`), with no label inside it.\n- The result starts at `0`.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and required IDs (`left`, `right`, `operation`, `calculate`, `result`).\n- `style.css` — pixel-style theme, responsive layout, focus/hover/pressed states.\n- `script.js` — calculation logic using `addEventListener`.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- No packages, network requests, storage, iframes, or server code.\n- Plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript only.\n- Controls are keyboard accessible and labeled.\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
